<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/analysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Analytical evaluating of data, designs, or processes methodically to verify correctness against standards or expectations. Typical analysis methods are FMEA, FTA, STPA, static analysis for MISRA compliance etc."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/nuget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reference to a NuGet package. The package locator format is defined in the [NuGet documentation](https://docs.nuget.org) and looks like `package/version`."@en .
